    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've tried talking. it doesn't help. they just say \"it's okay\" and try to fix things, but it's not okay. it just keeps going. i keep thinking... if i wasn't here, they wouldn't have to deal with this. they could actually move on and be happy without having to worry about me all the time. wouldn't that be more compassionate than just letting me continue to be this problem for them?",
